# M&A Due Diligence Automation System

## Overview

AI-assisted M&A due diligence intelligence platform for Indian publicly listed companies. Runs on Android Termux with Python 3, using only free/public data sources.

**⚠️ IMPORTANT DISCLAIMER:** This is an analyst-assistance tool, not a replacement for legal or financial advisors. Every finding includes source references and confidence scores.

---

## System Requirements

| Requirement | Specification |
|-------------|---------------|
| Platform | Android Termux |
| Python | 3.8+ |
| Storage | 100 MB minimum |
| Network | Required for data fetching (cached for offline) |

